 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 11417,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1063\">For DFA, we must define transitions for every symbol from each state. DFA needs:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1158\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1170\" data-start=\"1158\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1170\" data-start=\"1160\">q0 (start)</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"1171\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"1173\">q1 (seen &lsquo;a&rsquo;)</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1187\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1189\">q2 (seen &lsquo;ab&rsquo; &rarr; accept)</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1232\" data-start=\"1214\">DFA transitions:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1340\" data-start=\"1233\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1233\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1235\">&delta;(q0, a) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1268\" data-start=\"1251\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1268\" data-start=\"1253\">&delta;(q0, b) = q0</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1269\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1271\">&delta;(q1, a) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1304\" data-start=\"1287\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1304\" data-start=\"1289\">&delta;(q1, b) = q2</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1305\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1307\">&delta;(q2, a) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1340\" data-start=\"1323\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1340\" data-start=\"1325\">&delta;(q2, b) = q0</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1342\">NFA can use &epsilon;-transitions or nondeterminism:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1387\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1387\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1389\">From start, go to state that expects &lsquo;a&rsquo; &rarr; &lsquo;b&rsquo; without specifying full transitions.<br />\n\tNFA accepts &lsquo;ab&rsquo; but can also be in multiple states at once.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1623\" data-start=\"1535\">Hence, NFA is more flexible but harder to simulate manually; DFA is rigid but efficient.</p>\n",
